            "line": 727,
            "text": "@[simp] theorem physicalToChart_apply (h : ℝ) (n i : ℕ) (z : PressureStream.Lift Plane) :\n    physicalToChart h n i z = (chartScale n * z.1,\n      ((ChartScales.Q n ^ (-CoordinateAlgebra.D h) * z.2.1.1,\n        ChartScales.Q n ^ (-1 : ℝ) * z.2.1.2), TemporalMeanUpdate.coverMap i z.2.2))"
